WEBVTT

00:14:27.146 --> 00:14:30.407
something that you want to see changed
on a national or global scale.

00:14:30.431 --> 00:14:31.676
Think big.

00:14:32.872 --> 00:14:34.866
What would resolution look like?

00:14:35.827 --> 00:14:36.986
On a large scale,

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.235
what would it look like
to solve that problem?

00:14:40.137 --> 00:14:42.804
Can you get there with just
your circle of friends?

00:14:43.301 --> 00:14:44.498
I know you can't.

00:14:44.522 --> 00:14:47.381
The anarchist-communist soccer
tournament isn't going to help

00:14:47.405 --> 00:14:49.136
bring about that change.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.906
So I want to think about how
we can expand our circle a little more.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:55.039
Where is there common ground to be found?

00:14:56.265 --> 00:14:59.182
Can you think of any unlikely allies?

00:14:59.596 --> 00:15:01.012
Strange partners?